        "spans_beyond_this_verse": false,
        "text": "Seetha's conduct is the primary aspect and Ravana's elimination is secondary in the epic of Ramayana. poulasthyavadha . Giving one to many names to poem/epics is usual as in maaghakaavya' which is known as shishupaalavadha whereas it is actually kR^iShNacarita ."
